---
/**
 * Switching Vendors — copy doc §10.
 *
 * Aimed at the switching moment. "Stay where you are" is the strongest move on
 * the page: a firm confident enough to send you away is believed about
 * everything above it, and a happy buyer was never converting anyway.
 *
 * Nothing here needs evidence. No numbers, no testimonials, no claims.
 */
import { site } from "../../data/site";
import Section from "../layout/section.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../ui/sectionHeading.astro";
import Button from "../ui/button.astro";
---

<Section id="switching" width="narrow">
  <SectionHeading align="center" eyebrow="Switching Vendors">
    How many hours did your team spend fixing the last model you received?
  </SectionHeading>

  <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-center text-[15px] leading-8">
    <p>If the answer is zero, stay where you are. We mean that.</p>

    <p class="text-muted-foreground">
      If you had to count, here's what's different on our end. The same people
      on every one of your projects. Questions answered in your time zone.
      Problems flagged in an issue list instead of buried in the geometry.
    </p>

    <p class="text-muted-foreground">
      We can pick up from a model you already have, or start from the markups.
      Either works.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-12 flex justify-center">
    <Button href={site.quoteHref}>{site.cta.primary}</Button>
  </div>
</Section>
